<title>PORTUGAL: Federal Home Loan issues 10 bln esc Navigator.</title>
<headline>Federal Home Loan issues 10 bln esc Navigator.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp is launching a 10-year 10 billion escudos Navigator with a fixed interest rate of 6.5 percent in the first four years and in the subsequent six years an inverse floater equivalent to 13 percent minus 12-month Lisbor, said lead managers Banco Cisf and Caixa Geral de Depositos.</p>
<p>The Navigator has a floor of four percent.</p>
</text>
